          %h3#cohomological_properties Cohomological properties
          %p
            A derivation of
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D-brane+charge"} D-brane charge
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/RR-fields"} RR-fields
            and other
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/K-theory"} K-theory
            structure in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/type+II+superstring+theory"} type II superstring theory
            from M-theory was argued in (
            %a{:href => "#FMW00"}> FMW 00
            ).
          %p
            See also at
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cubical+structure+in+M-theory"} cubical structure in M-theory
          %h3#kaluzaklein_compactifications Kaluza-Klein compactifications
          %div
            %p
              %strong
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-compactification"} KK-compactification
                of
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-theory"} M-theory
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-theory+on+a+circle"} M-theory on a circle
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-theory+on+8-manifolds"}> M-theory on 8-manifolds
                  \/
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-theory+on+Spin%287%29-manifolds"} on Spin(7)-manifolds
              %li
